  "contentHtml": "<div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/f50e73830710b05717a3d6f590f9eba8744d4fb8?download\" data-file-name=\"엘리멘탈 속 과학 이야기.hwpx\" data-file-size=\"4288839\" data-mimetype=\"application/haansofthwpx\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfMHp%26dataid%3D784%26fileid%3D2%26regdt%3D20231122135648&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2Ff50e73830710b05717a3d6f590f9eba8744d4fb8')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">엘리멘탈 속 과학 이야기</span><span class=\"type\">.hwpx</span></div><div class=\"size\">4.09MB</div></div></a></div><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/f26e03fef197a25ca50030de6e91ed8385e7fc47?download\" data-file-name=\"엘리멘탈 속 과학 이야기_답.hwpx\" data-file-size=\"4290579\" data-mimetype=\"application/haansofthwpx\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfMHp%26dataid%3D784%26fileid%3D1%26regdt%3D20231122135648&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2Ff26e03fef197a25ca50030de6e91ed8385e7fc47')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">엘리멘탈 속 과학 이야기_답</span><span class=\"type\">.hwpx</span></div><div class=\"size\">4.09MB</div></div></a></div><p>안녕하세요~</p><p>4. 기체의 성질, 5. 물질의 상태변화를 모두 배우고 쉬어가는 느낌으로 영화 &#39;엘리멘탈&#39;을 보여줬습니다.</p><p>상태변화, 보일샤를 법칙 등이 잘 나타나있어서 수업 내용 정리하기에도 좋았어요ㅎㅎ</p><p>&#160;</p><p>아래 30분짜리 요약 영상을 보여주고, 남은 시간동안 첨부된 활동지 문제를 풀어보고 답을 맞췄더니 한 차시 알차게 활용할 수 있었습니다.</p><p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=feyaQ2PW2o4&amp;ab_channel=%EC%95%BD%EB%8C%80%EC%8B%9C%EB%84%A4%EB%A7%88\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=feyaQ2PW2o4&amp;ab_channel=%EC%95%BD%EB%8C%80%EC%8B%9C%EB%84%A4%EB%A7%88</a></p><div class=\"figure-video\" data-ke-type=\"video\" data-video-url=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=feyaQ2PW2o4\" data-video-host=\"youtube\" data-video-play-service=\"daum_cafe\" data-video-width=\"868\" data-video-height=\"488\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-video-thumbnail=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/cbeV2K/hyUB89hkSs/AMfQsfOxm47YEPkWgWxQD1/img.jpg?width=1280&amp;height=720&amp;face=0_0_1280_720\" data-ke-mobile-mobilestyle=\"widthContent\" data-video-origin-width=\"868\" data-video-origin-height=\"488\"><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/feyaQ2PW2o4\" width=\"868\" height=\"488\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen=\"\"></iframe><div class=\"figcaption\"></div></div><p>&#160;</p><p>1학년 내용 이외에도 영화 전체에 과학적 요소들, 생각할거리들이 곳곳에 있어, 동아리나 자기개발시기용으로도 추천합니다!</p><p>&#160;</p><p>이런 얘기들을 해도 좋을 것 같아요~~</p><p>1.&#160;앰버와&#160;웨이드가&#160;아기를&#160;낳는다면? <br>-&#160;스팀&#160;베이비 <br>2.&#160;앰버가&#160;입은&#160;옷은&#160;어떤&#160;물질이길래&#160;녹지&#160;않을까? <br>-&#160;녹는점 <br>3.&#160;화가&#160;난&#160;앰버는&#160;보라색으로&#160;변한다. <br>-&#160;온도에&#160;따른&#160;불꽃의&#160;색(별의&#160;표면&#160;온도?) <br>4.&#160;앰버가&#160;광물을&#160;밟자&#160;불꽃색이&#160;변한다. <br>-&#160;금속&#160;원소의&#160;불꽃&#160;반응 <br>5.&#160;영화&#160;속&#160;4원소설과&#160;현대&#160;원소&#160;개념의&#160;차이 <br>6.&#160;앰버와&#160;웨이드의&#160;궁합&#160;장면:&#160;물방울을&#160;이용해서&#160;빛을&#160;굴절시켜&#160;나무에&#160;불을&#160;붙임 <br>-&#160;볼록렌즈에서&#160;빛의&#160;굴절 <br>7.&#160;루멘(밝기의&#160;단위)</p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
